    "Watch ad": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看广告"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch an ad for %lld free coins": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "看广告免费领 %lld 金币"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap ▶ +50 at the top to watch a short ad for 50 coins, once every 90 seconds, up to 10 times a day.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "点顶部的 ▶ +50 看一段短广告领 50 金币，每 90 秒一次，每天最多 10 次。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Each coin pushed off the front edge pays 1 coin. Coins that slide off the sides are lost.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "从前沿推落的每枚金币得 1 枚；从两侧滑落的不算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Glowing coins are special: each one pushed off pays 2 coins.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "发光的是特殊金币：每推落一枚得 2 金币。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A coin passing through the BONUS slider spins the slot machine. Three or more matching symbols in the middle row, starting from the left, win coins; a full row is the JACKPOT.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金币穿过 BONUS 滑块会转动老虎机。中间一行从最左边起连续 3 个及以上相同符号赢金币，整行相同就是 JACKPOT。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Coins crossing the battle make the King hit the BOSS. Knock it out to free the Queen, and 50 coins fall from the top. Tap the battle to skip the celebration.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "金币穿过战斗区，国王就攻击 BOSS。打倒它救出王后，50 枚金币从顶部落下。点一下战斗区可以跳过庆祝动画。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
